From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:32:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] soc: samsung: exynos-chipid: add Google gs201

gs201 reports product ID 0x9855000.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c b/drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c
index 6ef9751e2..c86a3130b 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/samsung/exynos-chipid.c
@@ -74,6 +74,7 @@ static const struct exynos_soc_id {
 	{ "EXYNOSAUTOV920", 0x0A920000 },
 	/* Compatible with: google,gs101-otp */
 	{ "GS101", 0x9845000 },
+	{ "GS201", 0x9855000 },
 };
 
 static const char *exynos_product_id_to_name(unsigned int product_id)
